WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Quit

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,440
This is what you said

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,200
Then go die

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,620
How could that happen? How could it be possible with my power?

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,860
Even the neck of a human being can be strangled.

6
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,130
Does this store manager really want to strangle me to death?

7
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:18,170
I am suffering from a mental illness, right? I am also suffering from lack of oxygen. No need.

8
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,650
A copy of a day working at a convenience store

9
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:21,970
Its BOSS has been killed

10
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,050
The copy ends early and the copy is liquidated

11
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:26,330
Players are asked to check it themselves in the game system

12
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,010
i survived

13
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:36,390
Could it be the store manager of Roujia?

14
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,020
I won't really beat anyone to death, right?

15
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,420
Should I call an ambulance?

16
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,060
If someone dies, you should call 110 first

17
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:46,150
It was he who beat the BOSS

18
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,700
He is clearly capable of killing the BOSS

19
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,100
why not earlier

20
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:54,640
But he seems to be injured too. Thanks, I'll go first.

21
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,760
You should leave quickly too
